⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of By Grabthar's Hammer
node GQT · GQT · ⟦By Grabthar's Hammer:GQT:c26408⟧

WHO   — By Grabthar's Hammer — the lament that becomes a goodbye
WHAT  — The film's tear: a line written to be cheesy that becomes, over a dying believer, the most sincere moment in the movie.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the movie's deepest magic is turning its biggest joke into its biggest feeling.
HOW   — By being despised for the whole film until Quellek dies invoking it, and Dane finally means every syllable.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I was written to be ridiculous. A boy died believing me, and his actor finally said me true. By Grabthar's Hammer.

